---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact via chat">
    <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Need help?</h1>

        <p class="mb-4">
            It's normal to get stuck on a level from time to time, don't
            despair!<br />
            Before reaching out for help, make sure you have read the level's description
            and hints carefully.<br />
            If you are still stuck, you can ask for help in the chatrooms, but remember
            to follow the <a href="/rules">rules</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="mb-4">
            You might want to read this <a
                href="http://catb.org/~esr/faqs/smart-questions.html"
                class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">article</a
            > before asking for help.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Discord</h2>

        <p class="mb-2">
            You can find our Discord server at <a
                href="https://discord.gg/CPDYM3G"
                class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline"
                >https://discord.gg/CPDYM3G</a
            >
        </p>

        <div class="ml-4 mb-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold">Channels:</h3>
            <ul class="list-none ml-4">
                <li><code>#wargames</code> (for talk related to the games)</li>
                <li><code>#social</code> (for general talk)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p class="mb-4 font-bold text-red-600">
            Please be aware of our rules! When you first connect, you will be
            reminded of them.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">IRC</h2>

        <p class="mb-2">
            If you don't know <a
                href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:IRC/Tutorial"
                class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline"
                >how to use IRC</a
            >, use google to find out.
        </p>

        <div class="ml-4 mb-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold">Encrypted IRC:</h3>
            <ul class="list-none ml-4 mb-2">
                <li>Host: <code>ircs.overthewire.org</code></li>
                <li>Port: <code>6697</code> (with SSL)</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="font-bold">Non-encrypted IRC:</h3>
            <ul class="list-none ml-4">
                <li>Host: <code>irc.overthewire.org</code></li>
                <li>Port: <code>6667</code></li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p class="mb-4">The channels used on IRC are the same as on Discord.</p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
